{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1000_p", "source_sha256": "79bd1965dec2f1b9dfa4fd15287a8fd22879c4e5f93002612b50bc0217096d9f", "ja": "（今日は律子が出演する『アイドル紅白歌祭り』。\n最終チェックもOK。本番まではまだ少し時間が……）", "zh": "（今天是律子参加的《偶像红白歌祭》。\n最后检查也没问题。离正式演出还有一会儿……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "0405574a2ac6b3992255824b33f9a5f1179185e38b7f85d8f920f0ef2f29a7aa", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}。\n早くから準備、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}。\n这么早就开始准备，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d6c73da437e8cbc9fc0adda9719a4d378b477a24b40c766af4f9e2485a777047", "ja": "あれ、律子？　ずいぶん早い到着だな。", "zh": "哎呀，律子？你来得挺早的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "9649f06f9d1af8aa8e0be561c62a739bc9e5ddeafd8e1628a22d7672dfc417ae", "ja": "別に、入り時間を間違えたわけじゃありませんよ。\n今日は、一年を締めくくる大事なイベントですから！", "zh": "才不是我搞错了进场时间呢。\n因为今天可是为一年画上句号的重要活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "cbd072bb924f5295ac1824ce735d4a3ce39c82fec4f14ff1563383541c7ca824", "ja": "……というのは建前で。家に居ても、なんだか\n落ち着かなくて……つい早めに来ちゃいました。", "zh": "……刚才那些只是场面话。就算待在家里，也总觉得静不下心来……不知不觉就提前到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6bc575039acc002bb47dede8eaaec608d2314b5d2ce519489828be1879f41aa6", "ja": "そうだよな。\n今日は、重要な役目も任されてるし……。", "zh": "是啊。今天还被交付了重要的任务……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "0291cec6dfd0d13ba5cf5ab723a2fb0ee0133651b423bc46f70ced9b3bda2cd4", "ja": "ま、そういうことです。まさか私がトリを務めることに\nなるなんて……今からソワソワしっぱなしですよ。", "zh": "嗯，就是这么回事。没想到居然会由我压轴出场……从现在开始就一直坐立不安了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6d344074148e62ae8133149b1abc0ecbfd88d1ed3800e2ffc68c20cdd717d6ca", "ja": "うん。でも、律子なら大丈夫。正直、全く\n心配してないよ。今の律子の表情を見たら、わかる。", "zh": "嗯。不过，如果是律子就没问题。我一点都不担心。看到现在律子的表情，就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "8411de59cf6da70215c21943ae0205f1a4f5bb18bffa05fdebe1ab3ce5f7c414", "ja": "表情、ですか？", "zh": "表情……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4e57a2708c9d440002d6805b448947cde4e91b3c6102815eb25cdcc6b3b6bf48", "ja": "ああ。ソワソワっていうより、\nワクワクしてるって、そう顔に書いてある。", "zh": "是啊。与其说是坐立不安，\n不如说是兴奋期待，你的表情已经把这些都写出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "1fad6f8601027d43f1edc85e82da3ee101b363a22ad58824e0642854080de507", "ja": "！　さすがですね、{$P$}殿。", "zh": "！不愧是您，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "d7b46525714b33dcd31ceb9fa033ebf6f76de8dee949c65e5ec8b9b4433279ae", "ja": "まあ……普通にプレッシャーはあります。\n私の実力で務まるのか、怖さみたいなものも……。", "zh": "嗯……当然还是有压力的。\n也会害怕，不知道凭我的实力能不能胜任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1012_p", "source_sha256": "333c7773790a11af6be4782f2e4d33e062a683f8d22f7cb96c1983539b7a01e9", "ja": "うん。それは、そうだよな……。", "zh": "嗯。确实会那样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "f388f97d1e7de797a350f86fe9d66c06d83a4a0089973ea30ac7ffd7b9e94144", "ja": "でも、今日を迎えて、なぜだか楽しみの方が大きく\nなってきました。なんか、吹っ切れちゃったのかも！", "zh": "不过，迎来今天之后，不知为什么，期待反而越来越强烈了。也许是彻底想通了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "2f62ddc49c3d8eff6eb38aec25918707053f5b1eb586fe2d7dc45b773122cc00", "ja": "私のステージで、みんなが良い年を迎えられるように\n……。今はやる気でいっぱいなんです！", "zh": "希望大家都能在我的舞台上迎来美好的一年……现在我可是干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b24862e7833b97667faa3f652d66cfce75535777dd09f6c849d8129f528fa775", "ja": "ははっ、気合いは十分ってことか。\nこれはますます楽しみになってきたな！", "zh": "哈哈，看来干劲十足啊。\n这下更让人期待了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0443_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "bd1e41c5815017ce84f4172612b831fef5b6dbd00e08816a153f9fb8e877ca85", "ja": "ふふ。一年の締めくくりに相応しい、素敵なステージに\nしてみせますから。ちゃんと見ててくださいね♪", "zh": "呵呵。我会把它变成配得上一年收尾的精彩舞台。请一定要好好看着哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
